/*
 * The surface half. n: unit normal (map basis); V: toward the eye (only the rock strata's footprint on a
 * face uses it; the bake passes n); fp: pixel footprint (m); detail: 0 = the TypeScript mirror (flat, no
 * noise), 1 = full. near: 1 on the launch patch, where loc (site metres: x east, y north), east/north
